        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-crypto",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · cryptocurrency"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s7"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Strip away the charts and the slogans, and it is really just a fight over who sells to whom.",
